# PENPY-P9-MIN-5: pickled SA graphs are local-only artifacts. They
# should never be committed (HMAC-signed pickle bodies are host-secret
# bound and large, hundreds of MB to multiple GB). The generic `*.pkl`
# covers them; the explicit dell_ingest.pkl line is a belt-and-braces
# guard for the one that exists in dev trees.
*.pkl
dell_ingest.pkl
*.db
CLAUDE.md
.claude/worktrees/
# A stray node_modules tree was committed here once and had to be cut out of
# history. Vendored dependencies do not belong in this repo.
node_modules/
